{"packageRef":{"id":"content.c.p05","version":"1.0.0"},"subject":{"id":"exercise.c.odd-sum-until-stop","version":"1.0.0","title":"break、continue与有效累加","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"lessonRef":{"id":"lesson.c.loop-control","version":"1.0.0"},"learningRevision":1,"acceptedPriorVersions":[],"knowledgeRefs":[{"id":"knowledge.c.loops","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.conditions","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.expressions","version":"1.0.0"}],"programRef":{"id":"program.c.practice-odd-sum-until-stop","version":"1.0.0"},"judgeRef":{"id":"judge.c.odd-sum-until-stop","version":"1.0.0"},"prompt":"n和stop各为0到30，目标是1..n中不超过stop的奇数和。stop可以大于n，无需把输入强行改小；在原n边界结束即可。\n\n教学目标：遍历1..n，超过stop真实break，偶数真实continue，其余奇数有效累加。\n\n所有测试都须正常结束且main返回0。必须让当前真实执行的数据与控制过程满足目标，不能用固定答案、死读取或未执行结构代替。","tests":[{"caseKey":"empty","input":{"n":0,"stop":5},"expectedStdout":"0\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"break-first","input":{"n":7,"stop":0},"expectedStdout":"0\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"break-middle","input":{"n":7,"stop":3},"expectedStdout":"4\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"continue","input":{"n":7,"stop":7},"expectedStdout":"16\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"maximum","input":{"n":30,"stop":30},"expectedStdout":"225\n","expectedExitCode":0}],"rewardRef":{"id":"reward.exercise.first-pass","version":"1.0.0"}},"program":{"id":"program.c.practice-odd-sum-until-stop","version":"1.0.0","title":"break、continue与有效累加参考","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"subsetRef":{"id":"subset.c.p0","version":"1.0.0"},"inputRef":{"id":"input.c.odd-sum-until-stop","version":"1.0.0"},"exampleInput":{"n":7,"stop":3},"sourceExample":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 7;\n    int stop = 3;\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i = i + 1) {\n        if (i > stop) {\n            break;\n        }\n        if (i % 2 == 0) {\n            continue;\n        }\n        sum = sum + i;\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", sum);\n    return 0;\n}\n","bindings":[{"bindingKey":"param.n","inputKey":"n","targetName":"n","targetKind":"scalar","from":"field"},{"bindingKey":"param.stop","inputKey":"stop","targetName":"stop","targetKind":"scalar","from":"field"}],"blockRefs":[{"id":"block.c.main","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.integer","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-int","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.assign-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.unary","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.printf","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.return","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.for","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.if","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.comparison","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.arithmetic","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.break","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.continue","version":"1.0.0"}],"reference":{"document":"项目文档/验收/P0.5-09-正文审校.md","locator":"05.03；项目原创；受P0-C约束"}},"inputSpec":{"id":"input.c.odd-sum-until-stop","version":"1.0.0","title":"break、continue与有效累加输入","fields":[{"key":"n","kind":"integer","min":0,"max":30},{"key":"stop","kind":"integer","min":0,"max":30}],"relations":[]},"judgeProfile":{"id":"judge.c.odd-sum-until-stop","version":"1.0.0","title":"break、continue与有效累加教学检查","rule":"break-continue-odd-sum","targetDescription":"遍历1..n，超过stop真实break，偶数真实continue，其余奇数有效累加。"}}